---
title: Failure Recovery — Preserve Identity and Separate Acceptance from Processing
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph Phone["Mobile failures • local orchestration tested"]
    Loss["Connectivity loss / backend temporarily unavailable"]
    Keep["SQLite retains draft, files, clientClaimId and next retry"]
    Resume["Foreground / reconnect / scheduler<br/>Replay same ID after backoff"]
    Lost["API committed but response lost"]
    Dedupe["Customer + clientClaimId constraint<br/>Return original claim / reference"]
    Upload["Crash or failure during evidence upload"]
    Evidence["Retain accepted ID; reconcile completion<br/>Fresh URL; retry incomplete whole files"]
    Attention["Permanent error / missing file<br/>Preserve work; actionable manual recovery"]
    Loss --> Keep --> Resume --> Dedupe
    Lost --> Resume
    Upload --> Evidence
    Evidence -->|"permanent failure"| Attention
  end
  subgraph Integration["Integration failures • local queue / legacy substitutes"]
    Down["Legacy outage / timeout"]
    Buffer["Retain eligible intent<br/>Backoff + breaker; bounded consumers"]
    Restore["Dependency recovers<br/>Drain backlog; reconcile status"]
    Crash["Worker crash"]
    Lease["Visibility expires; redeliver<br/>Skip locally finalized delivery"]
    Ambiguous["Legacy may have committed<br/>Local acknowledgment absent"]
    Lookup["Query verified reference / legacy-number contract"]
    Found["Found: repair delivery state and poll status"]
    Safe["Confirmed absent + durable dedupe<br/>Replay SAME reference"]
    Hold["Unknown / no safe dedupe<br/>Quarantine; operator resolution"]
    Dead["Transient / poison attempts exhausted<br/>DLQ; diagnose before audited redrive"]
    Down --> Buffer --> Restore
    Buffer --> Dead
    Crash --> Lease --> Ambiguous
    Ambiguous --> Lookup
    Lookup --> Found
    Lookup --> Safe
    Lookup --> Hold
  end
  subgraph Region["Regional recovery • production design only"]
    Disaster["Primary region unavailable"]
    Fence["Fence writers; promote replica<br/>Measure loss; verify objects / clean verdicts"]
    Rebuild["Recovery manifest from surviving DB<br/>Rebuild regional queue; resolve ambiguous sends"]
    Canary["Canary; switch traffic; gradually resume"]
    Disaster -.-> Fence -.-> Rebuild -.-> Canary
  end
  Note["No exactly-once distributed guarantee<br/>Local stub dedupe is memory-only; real contract unverified<br/>No guaranteed terminated-app sync; DR targets are untested"]
